___________________________________| HELP |__________________________________
| To Select: Use the arrow keys to make selections from the menus.          |
|            - Up and Down arrow, scroll menus and windows up and down.     |
|            - Right arrow, puts the current selection into the command line|
|            - Left arrow:                                                  |
|               In the Actions menu, will select the Event window, to allow |
|                  back scrolling.                                          |
|               In other menus, will inactivate that menu, removing the last|
|                  selection from the command line.                         |
| To Redraw: ^R or ^L Will refresh the screen.                              |
|________________________[ TO EXIT, Type [SPACE] ^R ]_______________________|
